{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45817","headline":"别卢使君 · 贯休","name":"别卢使君","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"杜宇声声急，行行楚水濆。\n道无裨政化，行处傲孤云。\n幸到膺门下，频蒙俸粟分。\n诗虽曾引玉，棊数中埋军。\n山好还寻去，恩深岂易云。\n扇风千里泰，车雨九重闻。\n晴雾和花气，危樯鼓浪文。\n终期陶铸日，再见信陵君。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45817.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45817","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}